// 17(21):20200314, 2020) and [23] Saha et al. (JMMM 529:167882, 2021).
// NOTE: ResetCurrent = 12.5 uA is implausibly low for a 16 nm STT-MTJ
// AP->P switch. Published 16-22 nm pMTJ critical currents at ~7 ns are
// typically 30-100 uA. Combined with SetCurrent = 80 uA this gives a 6.4x
// asymmetry, roughly 3x larger than the ~2x typically measured.
// Sanity-check before use.
