// NOTE: Capacity units in Table II are written 'kb'/'Mb' (lowercase b =
// bits). A 256 kbit L1 and 1 Mbit L2 are plausible; but if the authors
// meant kB/MB the array-level context changes by 8x. The paper is
// ambiguous.
// NOTE: ReadCurrent solved by --auto-read; the paper's value did not admit
// a valid sense scheme at a safe MTJ read bias.

